        {
          "type": "text",
          "duration": 190,
          "text": {
            "en_us": "Your inhabited form reverts to a backup ability (consume one on a lethal hit to blink away and briefly turn invincible); you glow throughout for the hunt, while stealing a random item from each player (except keys and letters; guns/revolvers are copied, not taken). If your hotbar can't hold stolen items, they go into a non-full storage bag.",
            "zh_cn": "终幕：当游戏即将结算时，若你存活且至少有 1 个备选宿主，游戏不会结束，而是进入 80 秒的「寻找阿蒙」终幕。",
            "zh_tw": "終幕：當遊戲即將結算時，若你存活且至少有 1 個備選宿主，遊戲不會結束，而是進入 80 秒的「尋找阿蒙」終幕。"
